{"version":1,"content":"<p>在創始人黃仁勳離開後，英偉達管理層試圖向市場證明，公司業務不會因此受到影響，但未來對外投資的策略可能更加審慎。當地時間11月17日，英偉達（NVDA）發佈2027財年第三季度財報並舉辦電話會。這是黃仁勳辭去公司CEO職務後，英偉達首次與投資者進行直接的正式溝通。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586904.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:47:02.545360+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T06:28:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T06:40:20.985839+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T06:40:20.985839+00:00","content_hash":"e875a96e271317a67924dc9521eda1d1a3af0ce43cb98ac0690ed792947ba74b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}